#: scenario8:scenario8_79B311FB_7D6D_4461_ABCC_6EEC3B8E85DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c76ea8ecfde18f653b5ec0d6592b680764cae6de4b3c1c6b618a5edc88c631ff
