msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was picturesque."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Era pitoresco."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E40F536E_2011_4E5B_8A02_79D40DFD0443
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e4597b16fc5a93636acb19448e33b9fac7dfd0cb71b12674183e453035be6aa
#. default-sha256: 0c40866124821358ebb7fd16d1767de66ef35f9c94ad8bad4be73586e463481f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E40F536E_2011_4E5B_8A02_79D40DFD0443"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And you were always there with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E você sempre estava lá comigo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49cc7c0bb89630b4fe222c945e062788bdc891d36dfd55b1670edd76afcebcfe
#. default-sha256: c7b0891e70ac09accf1d8ae05295a5d678dd8717ea0aa52fd99ab5f301cba57c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Following my seventeenth birthday, though, I was met with a deluge of changes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Porém, após meu aniversário de dezessete anos, fui recebido por um dilúvio de mudanças."

#: scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8c21012a919ade2ce2006af3218ec12f1194b49f1304bd042b2445180cdb896
#. default-sha256: 04df2613d1e6f8b0bda9ca67ebd2f33aef64f715c283264e2474f270e07aaced
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫First, Father fell ill... ⟪k:1⟫and passed away shortly thereafter...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With his death "
"came the question of who would be the next head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Primeiro, o Pai adoeceu... ⟪k:1⟫e faleceu logo depois...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Com sua morte surgiu a "
"questão de quem seria o próximo chefe."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ac25994c82c052ed34737d384a3c2a95bcd586c3c82d50efa3ca167d6544c44
#. default-sha256: ecf7725317e367084bee4afeae7f752fe9b20e5c4474131662a962715b768c6d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was seventeen, by all means enough of an adult to handle things myself. ⟪k:1⟫Or, well, "
"that’s what I thought, anyway."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu tinha dezessete anos, era adulto o suficiente para cuidar das coisas sozinho. ⟪k:1⟫Ou, "
"bem, foi o que pensei, de qualquer maneira."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35c7dd9d44126f01d6b28f3b65df85d8ea4fb02e98e4f97b5176ff980c22f7e1
#. default-sha256: 69ae76e45d461281364b8049670e0ba1cf543ca2902583e508551c77ea77e850
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a small house, far from home—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫his way of making it hard for me to come back. "
"⟪k:3⟫Not that I had any intention of returning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era uma habitação pequena, longe de casa—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a maneira dele de dificultar minha volta. "
"⟪k:3⟫Não que eu tivesse qualquer intenção de voltar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66107b34138186fcbbe50ae53dac8320789e54b2a3cd05c799cfe8184f055196
#. default-sha256: 447851c88409145ad74f36cdd969cfebf9484cece486206847e13492faf394e5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was you coming with me, Nellie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫foi você vir comigo, Nellie."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ce48f44bc1c32e0b8e902e81edc749310efe0617647ab730457a5cc8976b414
#. default-sha256: 1e69d889da47a6a95f96df30f0bd92c7e3bc01217080375daa795bcd4f4cc643
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yep, so it is..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Aham, é isso..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c98c11f65830bdcc792e55ffeb1b4cec41dada231929337e46759ea198945ee5
#. default-sha256: 3836b8ee5898d54c16d40f390f43cd91c427f75ef6e7f37ba94a0bba43de3d98
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’s amazing how... ⟪k:1⟫little there is.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No big yard, no paintings, no vases "
"filled with colorful flowers,⟪k:4⟫no silver bowls full of fresh-picked fruit..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫É incrível o como... ⟪k:1⟫tem pouca coisa.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sem quintal grande, sem pinturas, sem "
"vasos cheios de flores coloridas,⟪k:4⟫sem tigelas de prata cheias de frutas recém-colhidas..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddfcc50cf9532ebb74952ab540b4716eb70589f19ee1cb4904ab8baead4bcadc
#. default-sha256: 39d8061e4e02d9455fe0f0f684625797890dbfe2ea5a301d250278be3e65dd95
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’ll do whatever I can for you, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you hungry? I’m hungry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Farei tudo o que puder por você, querido Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Está com fome? Eu estou com "
"fome."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf4db619b23a3af36b497ac9c73483aeb9272133deee697ef213f3e0d9be9948
#. default-sha256: 77eab81d73367b5c4dbb08ee7a07baf31e90d626a780a2ccf096662247de4ad5
