msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was... ⟪k:3⟫planning on using it for supper."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu estava... ⟪k:3⟫planejando usá-la para o jantar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DDE67F71_752F_46B9_B0BF_974E59FB2505
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
