msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Uhh, ⟪k:3⟫if I remember... ⟪k:4⟫the guy said you have to pluck its feathers, then "
"cut off its head and drain all the blood..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Uhh, ⟪k:3⟫se bem me lembro... ⟪k:4⟫o cara disse que tem que arrancar as penas, "
"depois cortar a cabeça e drenar todo o sangue..."

