msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Os cozinheiros lá de casa sempre cuidaram disso."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3737D91C_677F_4BC1_BCC4_B8F5346B51B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
