#: scenario8:scenario8_0423FDF5_FF77_4665_8471_0BFCAFBE6DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1d62c4997bb3987ce5ccb4abbf9af85b678768e0ec0fee2695344513ae8dab6
