msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_758D1741_451D_42C8_8E0D_94FF9BF61F48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, I heard whispers—⟪k:1⟫whispers of a witch who lived by the lake."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E então, um dia, ouvi sussurros—⟪k:1⟫sussurros de uma bruxa que vivia perto do lago."

#: scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e389d958468711d926437a96923156619692f5114e07a9a504f6c4485c90703
#. default-sha256: ea1bcc91de1e56ca706277979467e428087e0fe95c50bf8927c643a62ce47851
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing the thin trails of smoke rising from the chimney, I was convinced the rumors were "
"true. A witch lived in that house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ao ver os finos rastros de fumaça saindo da chaminé, fiquei convencido de que os rumores "
"eram verdadeiros. Uma bruxa morava naquela casa."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15555856f6d8c801726e5208def721c8838d71a873882c3b40915e07f1c0c815
#. default-sha256: 4a5d0a775430396ed787b916bc4ea8e9e2d6b1fd1f58878a7849a0037a8c5c97
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure what to expect. Being a recluse, I figured she wasn’t going to be very "
"sociable, at least. ⟪k:1⟫To tell you the truth, I was kind of scared to knock on her door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não tinha certeza do que esperar. Sendo reclusa, imaginei que ela não seria muito "
"sociável, pelo menos. ⟪k:1⟫Para falar a verdade, fiquei com um pouco de medo de bater na porta "
"dela."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9873A66F_9A39_4DE5_B2CA_8367360A0FCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d6e9ac5fbe1aaadbfca128bba7528e2baa86952135b80be00b3e4356624def0
