msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Quem está aí?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef7ce2ad14afcef9a007de0ac4838ce3c808ddbf42d8cf2d6162ad4b656da797
