msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She repeated her question, which brought me back to reality, ⟪k:1⟫though I still had to "
"fight to maintain my wits enough to respond coherently."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela repetiu sua pergunta, o que me trouxe de volta à realidade, ⟪k:1⟫embora eu ainda tivesse "
"que lutar para manter minha capacidade de responder de forma coerente."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2FB7C6B2_E1E4_40FD_9D03_BCD0FDDC7FD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6c48b2465a554568090d14f45d7ce94a4da4d7fad905be5d1edf52a6f079d41
